# managed by devkit — do not edit; fix upstream in ~/Developer/projects/devkit
# The go pack's selection: a changed Go file or module file runs kit-go-lint (gofmt, go mod tidy, golangci-lint) and kit-go-test on that
# module. Read after config/check-map. kit-go-test is a set of units (one per package dir): scripts/kit/go-test.sh lists and runs them.
**/*.go kit-go-lint kit-go-test
**/go.mod kit-go-lint kit-go-test
**/go.sum kit-go-lint kit-go-test
.golangci.yml kit-go-lint
@test-gate kit-go-test
@units kit-go-test scripts/kit/go-test.sh
